## Limitations

* Buffered, not streamed: very large windows would need a streaming response.
* The top referrer is per day, not a full breakdown; the JSON analytics endpoint has the
  window-level top referrers, browsers and devices.
* Spreadsheets show the neutralising quote as part of the cell text.

## Rollback

Revert the release patch: it removes the route, the export use case and constants in
`shortener/services/analytics_service.py`, the `daily_top_referrers` query in
`shortener/storage/click_repository.py` and `shortener/services/csv_export.py`. No data or
schema changes are involved, so nothing has to be undone in the database.
